This crate builds lStewieAl's Tweaks (nvse_stewie_tweaks, "lStewieAl's Tweaks and Engine Fixes"),
the NVSE plugin by lStewieAl, into nv-rs, with its author's permission (the maintainer, 2026-11-03:
every mod author gave it). Source read: Tweaks 10.05 (the archive "Stewie Tweaks Source 10.1",
Internal/Version.h 10.05). Its fixes are rebuilt from that source and the game's own code; no C++ is
included.

Credits: lStewieAl's Tweaks is written by lStewieAl.

Its INI is read by the rules of SimpleIni (Brodie Thiesfield, MIT licence), which Tweaks uses; the
rules are written here anew from that library's source, none of its code is included.

data/settings.tsv holds the values of Viva New Vegas' "VNV INI" for Tweaks
(ModdingLinked, https://github.com/ModdingLinked/Stewie-Tweaks-INIs), under the MIT License, whose
